participants: Browser, DNS resolver, Server
== 1. name lookup ==
Browser -> DNS resolver: where is www.example.com?
DNS resolver --> Browser: 203.0.113.7
== 2. TCP handshake (1 RTT) ==
Browser -> Server: SYN
Server --> Browser: SYN-ACK
== 3. TLS 1.3 handshake (1 RTT) ==
Browser -> Server: ClientHello + key share
Server --> Browser: ServerHello, certificate, finished
== 4. HTTP request ==
Browser -> Server: GET / (encrypted)
Server --> Browser: 200 OK, first bytes of the page
